## Return

Return exactly one bare JSON object, with no Markdown fence or surrounding prose.
Its keys are `verdict` and `subject`. The verdict is `APPROVE`, `REJECT` or
`BLOCKED`. Only `APPROVE` permits a binding. For approval, `subject` is exactly
the chosen candidate object plus `word` and `candidates_sha256` copied from the
export. Keep every value unchanged, including the complete `labels` and
`definitions` lists. Include no extra subject fields. Never return a free-text
gloss. For rejection or a blocker, return `subject: null`.

